   "rating": 4,
   "date": "2006-10-25T05:19:49-05:00",
   "body": "At level 60 the quest and the mobs are gray so you only get 1 rep per kill and 2 or 3 rep per turn-in for an average of 1/2 a rep per necklace. However, if you go to Jintha'Alor (63,73 The Hinterlands) you will find some level 48 and 49 elites. Mobs level 48 and up are green to you at 60 so they give 5 rep each instead of 1. Also, there is a rare spawn near The Altar of Zul that gives 25 rep when killed. Once you get to revered you can't get any rep from kills.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2006-01-06T05:19:49-06:00",
   "body": "For those keeping track, each troll killed off gets +5 Wildhammer, each set of 5 troll necklaces gains another +25 Wildhammer reputation.\n\nNow, if only reputation would actually buy anything.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2006-08-13T05:19:49-05:00",
   "body": "I just completed this easily with my 43 level rogue.&nbsp; The first time you get the 5 necklaces, you get 3900 XP and the 100 Rep. points.&nbsp; Each subsequent time you complete it you get ONLY 390 XP and 25 rep points.&nbsp; So in otherwords its worth doing the first time cause its pretty easy but a waste of time doing it anymore.&nbsp; That being said, if your picking them up while doing other quests then its worth having that one slot set aside in your quest item bag.&nbsp;",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2007-04-10T16:51:01-05:00",
